==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|filu||many}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*felu}}. More at {{m|en|fele}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fiːl/|lang=de}}
* {{auفراس
io|De-viel.ogg|audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|iːl|lang=de}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|de|pronoun}}

# [[much]], [[a lot]]
#: {{ux|de|Es ist '''viel''' passiert.|t=Much has happened.}}

====Usage notes====
* Compare the similar, but semantically different pronoun {{m|de|vieles}}.

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|mehr|meisten}}

# [[much]], [[many]]
#: {{ux|de|[[er|Er]] [[haben|hat]] '''viel''' [[Geld]] [[verloren]].|t=He lost much money.}}
#* '''1800''', ''Monatsschrift für Deutsche; zur Veredlung der Kentnisse, zur Bildung des Geschmaks, und zu froher Unterhaltung. Zweyter Band'', Leipzig, page 123:
#*: ... mit '''mehrerer''' Zartheit der Empfindung und mit '''mehrerer''' Empfindlichkeit des Gewissens ...
#* '''2014''', Sandra Schwartz, ''Sieh mich jetzt'', Lindhardt und Ringhof, [https://books.google.com/books?id=XlPHAwAAQBAJ&pg=PT108&dq=mehrerem sine pagine (chapter 11)]:
#*: „Hey“, sage ich, als ich nach '''mehrerem''' Klingeln ans Telefon gehe.

====Declension====
* In the singular, the adjective is left unchanged when it is not preceded by an article or determiner (see example sentence above). Otherwise it is declined like a normal adjective: ''das viel'''e''' Geld''.
* In the plural, the adjective is usually declined even without a preceding article or determiner: ''viele Kinder''. However, it is sometimes left unchanged in the combinations {{m|de|wie}} ''viel'' (“how many”) and {{m|de|so}} ''viel'' (“so many”): ''wie viel Kinder'' or ''wie viele Kinder''.
* The comparative form {{m|de|mehr}} is invariable and never declined; it cannot be preceded by any article or determiner. Note however that there are {{m|de|mehres}}, {{m|de|mehre}}, {{m|de|mehreres}} and {{m|de|mehrere}}. The superlative ''meist-'' is declined like a normal adjective.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|de|mehrere Zahl}}

===Adverb===
{{de-adv|mehr|meisten}}

# [[much]], [[a lot]]
#: {{ux|de|Wir haben '''viel''' gelacht.|t=We laughed a lot.}}

===Derived terms===
* {{l|de|soviel}}
* {{l|de|wieviel}}

===See also===
* {{l|de|manch}}

